---
title: Agent turn lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Thinking: user prompt
    Thinking --> ToolCall: needs a tool
    ToolCall --> Thinking: tool result
    Thinking --> Streaming: has an answer
    Streaming --> Idle: turn finalized
    Thinking --> Interrupted: user interrupts
    ToolCall --> Interrupted: user interrupts
    Interrupted --> Idle: state flushed
    Idle --> [*]: chat archived

    note right of ToolCall
        Queued steering messages
        drain here, not mid-tool.
    end note
